Konversi algoritma pencarian biner (Binary Search) Python berikut ke Widya-Lang:

```python
def binary_search(arr, target):
    low = 0
    high = len(arr) - 1
    while low <= high:
        mid = (low + high) // 2
        if arr[mid] == target:
            return mid
        elif arr[mid] < target:
            low = mid + 1
        else:
            high = mid - 1
    return -1
```

Berikut implementasi Binary Search di Widya-Lang:

```widya
fungsi cari_biner(arr, target) {
    misal bawah = 0;
    misal atas = panjang(arr) - 1;

    selama (bawah <= atas) {
        misal tengah = (bawah + atas) / 2;
        jika (arr[tengah] == target) {
            kembalikan tengah;
        } selain_itu jika (arr[tengah] < target) {
            bawah = tengah + 1;
        } selain_itu {
            atas = tengah - 1;
        }
    }
    kembalikan -1;
}
```

